    "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_\n\n**Await the save before responding.**\n\n`save()` returns a promise, so the handler can answer before the row is written and a failure is lost.\n\n```diff\n-  save(row);\n+  await save(row);\n   return c.json({ ok: true });\n```\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nIn src/save.ts around lines 10 to 12, the handler calls save(row) without awaiting it; await the promise so errors reach the error handler.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:example -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
